      "side": 1,
      "message": "is_admin_project already implied that you are the \u0027admin\u0027, regardless of the role. So there\u0027s no need to check for both. Some deployments do the v3 policy file as a template so your changes will break existing deployments.\n\nThe rule I suggested should work for both\n\n\"cloud_admin\": \"(rule:admin_required and domain_id:admin_domain_id) or is_admin_project:True\",",
